{"id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-nrandom.md","title":"n 随机性及其相对形式","display":"df-nrandom — n 随机性及其相对形式","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-nrandom"],"display":"df-nrandom — n 随机性及其相对形式","label":"43-df-nrandom","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7 Definition 9.7.1、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷189–191，PDF209–211","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-nrandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nrandom — n 随机性及其相对形式"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-nrandom"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7 Definition 9.7.1、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷189–191，PDF209–211"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^{(k)}\">\\(B^{(k)}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a> 的自然数迭代跳跃，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>。下式定义由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的随机性谓词及其相对形式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n^{A}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{(\\operatorname{AsSet}(A))^{(n-1)}}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_n^{A}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{(\\operatorname{AsSet}(A))^{(n-1)}}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>源书由Σ_n⁰类检验出发，Corollary 9.7.4证明与该跳跃形式等价。A的迭代跳跃不能未经证明替换成A⊕0^(n−1)。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7 Definition 9.7.1、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷189–191，PDF209–211。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$B^{(k)}$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]] 的自然数迭代跳跃，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。下式定义由正整数 $n$ 索引的随机性谓词及其相对形式。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$B^{(k)}$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]] 的自然数迭代跳跃，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。下式定义由正整数 $n$ 索引的随机性谓词及其相对形式。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$B^{(k)}$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]] 的自然数迭代跳跃，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。下式定义由正整数 $n$ 索引的随机性谓词及其相对形式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"B^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n^{A}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{(\\operatorname{AsSet}(A))^{(n-1)}}(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1408,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；n随机性、相对ML随机性与跳跃见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"ee571dca34fde189","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]] — n 随机性及其相对形式"},{"id":"28b8edbf5da834bc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)$、$<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-cea]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"93fb6c76704357a2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)$、$<_T,\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-genericity]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\varnothing<_TB$ 表示B具有非零Turing度。"},{"id":"716a4678ad674a84","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-weak2random]]。"},{"id":"574b0b43d52660b1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omeg